7. Live Call Transfer & Human Escalation
The AI should be able to transfer calls to a real employee when necessary.

For example:

Customer: "Can I speak with the manager?"

AI: "Absolutely. Let me see if someone is available to help you."

The system should attempt to transfer the call to the designated employee or shop phone number.

Requirements:

Configurable transfer phone numbers.

Different transfer destinations for different situations.

Transfer during business hours.

Transfer for urgent customer concerns.

Transfer for customers specifically requesting a person.

Transfer when the AI cannot answer confidently.

Ideally, the system should check whether the employee accepts the call before completing the transfer.

If nobody answers, the AI should return to the customer and offer to take a message.

