Final Product Vision

I want Tunde AI to become the go-to AI receptionist platform for the automotive repair industry.

It should feel like hiring a professional receptionist who works 24 hours a day, seven days a week, never misses a scheduled shift, understands automotive service requests, and helps the business convert more phone calls into booked appointments.

The platform should be simple enough that a shop owner with no technical experience can set up their AI receptionist, customize it, connect their phone number, and begin receiving appointments.

The two most important outcomes are:

For the customer: A natural, helpful phone conversation with an appointment booked correctly.

For the shop owner: Fewer unanswered opportunities, less time spent answering routine calls, and clear reporting showing the value the AI provides.

I want to build this as a serious, scalable SaaS company, not just a basic AI phone bot.